/A 2443 0 R
/Alt (Flowchart depicting the process of article selection from database searching and grey literature. In the identification phase, 1229 records from databases \(IEEE Xplore, Scopus, Science Direct, Web of Science\) and 27 from other sources were identified. Screening reduced records to 898, removing 331 duplicates. Further screening based on title and abstract excluded 311 and 206 articles respectively. In the eligibility phase, 381 full texts were assessed, excluding 330. Finally, 51 articles were selected from databases and 27 from other sources, totaling 78 articles.)
